  "narrative": {
    "intro": "M A Mortenson obligated $613M in federal contract obligations in FY2026 to date. M A Mortenson won 15 awards so far this fiscal year, with an average award size of $40.9M and year-over-year obligations up 3862.7%. Fiscal-year history shows obligations moved from $73.1M in FY21 to $144M in FY22, to $191M in FY23, to $163M in FY24, and to $15.5M in FY25 before reaching $613M in FY26. The Department of Defense is the primary buyer, accounting for $613M of obligations in FY2026 to date. Commercial and Institutional Building Construction is the dominant market with $611M in obligations, while Industrial Building Construction shows $1.9M. The General Services Administration appears with $124K in obligations. These figures are contract obligations for the fiscal-year-to-date period and present a current snapshot of M A Mortenson’s federal-market activity.",
