        "heading": "Why did obligations change so much year over year?",
        "body": "M A Mortenson year-over-year obligations are up 3862.7%. Fiscal-year trends show obligations rose from $15.5M in FY25 to $613M in FY26. The Department of Defense supplied the FY26 obligations with $613M."
