      {
        "heading": "Where is M A Mortenson doing most of its federal work?",
        "body": "Commercial and Institutional Building Construction is the primary market with $611M in obligations. The Department of Defense is the primary buyer with $613M in obligations. Industrial Building Construction accounts for $1.9M and the General Services Administration accounts for $124K."
      }
